Upstream-Name: OnionPress
Upstream-Contact: Brewster Kahle <brewster@archive.org>
Source: https://github.com/brewsterkahle/onionpress
Comment:
 The package holds OnionPress's own launcher, tray, Python package,
 WordPress plugins and theme, and container build contexts, and two shell
 scripts from Docker (Moby) under /opt/onionpress/docker-rootless, used
 only on a distribution whose docker.io ships no rootless setup tool
 (linux/docker-rootless/README.md in the source says which commit they
 come from). Tor, WordPress and MariaDB run from container images that
 Docker pulls at first start, and every other dependency is a Debian
 package named in the control file's Depends.

